The SteamOS provisioning approach builds on

    https://github.com/28allday/steamos-nvidia-installer

which established the offline NVIDIA-on-SteamOS pattern this project follows:
operate on an unmounted rootfs, fetch exact linux-neptune-*-headers from
Valve's mirror, build in a throwaway chroot, and survive atomic updates.
